{"status":"ready","content":"To compute \\( 987654321^2 \\) exactly, we can use the following steps:\r\n\r\n1. **Break down the number**: We can express 987654321 as \\( 10^9 - 12345679 \\).\r\n2. **Use the binomial expansion**: We use the formula for the square of a difference, \\((a - b)^2 = a^2 - 2ab + b^2\\), where \\( a = 10^9 \\) and \\( b = 12345679 \\).\r\n\r\nSo, we have:\r\n\\[\r\n987654321^2 = (10^9 - 12345679)^2\r\n\\]\r\n\\[\r\n= (10^9)^2 - 2 \\cdot 10^9 \\cdot 12345679 + (12345679)^2\r\n\\]\r\n\r\n3. **Calculate each term**:\r\n   - \\( (10^9)^2 = 10^{18} = 1000000000000000000 \\)\r\n   - \\( 2 \\cdot 10^9 \\cdot 12345679 = 2 \\cdot 1234567900000000 = 2469135800000000 \\)\r\n   - \\( (12345679)^2 \\) can be calculated as follows:\r\n     \\[\r\n     12345679^2 = 15241578750190521\r\n     \\]\r\n\r\n4. **Combine the terms**:\r\n\\[\r\n987654321^2 = 1000000000000000000 - 2469135800000000 + 15241578750190521\r\n\\]\r\n\r\n5. **Perform the subtraction and addition**:\r\n\\[\r\n1000000000000000000 - 2469135800000000 = 997530864200000000\r\n\\]\r\n\\[\r\n997530864200000000 + 15241578750190521 = 997530864200000000 + 15241578750190521 = 997530864200000000 + 15241578750190521 = 997530864200000000 + 15241578750190521 = 975308641975308641\r\n\\]\r\n\r\nSo, the exact value of \\( 987654321^2 \\) is:\r\n\\[\r\n\\boxed{975308641975308641}\r\n\\]\r\n","path":"responses/qwen2-5-72b-instruct/large-square.txt","size":1228,"mtime":1779279255}